e: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"verse-engine-2-0-release-notes-for-humans\">Verse Engine 2.0 — release notes for humans<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verse-engine-2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Verse Engine 2.0 is out, and the <a href=\"/docs/changelog\" id=\"lnk-changelog-3\">changelog</a> is long.\nThis is the short version, written for the people who will <em>use</em> Verse\nrather than build it: what you can do now, what changed if you were already\nusing it, and what is still marked &quot;beta&quot;.</p>\n<h2 id=\"in-one-paragraph\">In one paragraph<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#in-one-paragraph\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Verse turns a heavy 3D model or scan into a link. Open the link and the\nspace streams in — first a soft version of the whole thing in a few\nseconds, then detail wherever you look — in current browsers, on laptops\nand phones, with no app to install. 2.0 is the first\nrelease we call production: it is deployed, and its speed and colour\naccuracy are measured by automated tests.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-can-do-now\">What you can do now<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-you-can-do-now\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p><strong>Share a space with a link.</strong> Upload a <code>.glb</code> (or a scan) in the\nplayground, wait for the compile — a minute or two for a product, about\ntwenty minutes for a building — and copy the share link. Anyone can open\nit in a current browser. The file is\ndigitally signed, and the viewer shows &quot;signed&quot; once it has verified it.</p>\n<p><strong>Keep it private.</strong> Sign in (the account is a token, like an API key),\nflip a scene to <em>private</em>, and mint a share token per person. Each token\nis a separate key you can revoke later without touching the others.\nStrangers see nothing — not even that the scene exists.</p>\n<p><strong>Collect comments inside the space.</strong> Every share link doubles as a\nreview round. Your client clicks any spot and types a note; it is pinned to\nthat exact 3D position and everyone who opens the link sees the numbered\npin. You resolve or delete pins as the owner. No client account needed.</p>\n<p><strong>Export a video.</strong> One click records a flythrough — the automatic ~30 s\ntour the compiler lays out, or one you recorded — to a 1080p MP4 or WebM,\ninside the viewer&#39;s own browser. Nothing is uploaded.</p>\n<p><strong>Walk through it.</strong> Press <em>Walk</em>: real walls block you, stairs work,\nthe floor-plan minimap shows where you are. Measure a distance in two\nclicks. Or tour together live, as avatars, with follow mode.</p>\n<p><strong>Put it on your own website.</strong> One script tag embeds the viewer; your\npage needs no special headers or build step, and the embed reports events\n(ready, loaded, progress, picks, dwell time) your page can act on.</p>\n<p><strong>Publish from your tools.</strong> Blender has a one-click <em>Publish to Verse</em>\npanel, verified end to end. Unity and Unreal exporters exist and speak the\nsame protocol; they are marked beta until their first in-editor runs.\n<em>(Update, 4.0: the Unity and Unreal plug-ins have since been verified in the real editors — Unity 6000.6.5f1 and Unreal Engine 5.8.3 — and are no longer beta.)</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"what-changed-if-you-were-already-using-verse\">What changed if you were already using Verse<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-changed-if-you-were-already-using-verse\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>The viewer defaults to <strong>on-demand rendering</strong> in embeds: a still scene\ncosts essentially no battery. The playground still renders continuously.</li><li><strong>HDR display output</strong> is on automatically on HDR-capable screens for\nthe top device tier. Add <code>?hdr=0</code> to any link destined for an SDR screen\nor a video export.</li><li><strong>Share links never break.</strong> Every URL ever issued (<code>/?vpk=…</code>,\n<code>?experience=</code>, <code>?tour=</code>) keeps serving the app; the bare domain now\nshows the product page, and <code>/app</code> is the playground.</li><li><strong>Compiles are faster</strong> since 2.0.1: about 1.8× on large scenes, with\nbyte-identical output. If you run your own server, budget about 8 GB of\nmemory for ingest; the two compile phases now genuinely overlap.</li><li><strong>Errors are honest.</strong> Every error the app itself returns carries an\n<code>X-Verse-Error: 1</code> header and a JSON message, so you can always tell an\napp error from a network hiccup.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"what-is-still-beta\">What is still beta<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-is-still-beta\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Unity and Unreal publishing.</strong> Protocol-tested against a live server;\nthe first in-editor smoke test is pending. The Blender add-on is the\nreference. <em>(Update, 4.0: the Unity and Unreal plug-ins have since been verified in the real editors — Unity 6000.6.5f1 and Unreal Engine 5.8.3 — and are no longer beta.)</em></li><li><strong>Gaussian splats</strong> stream, but the walk-through, review and video\ntooling is still mesh-first.</li><li><strong>The WebGL2 fallback</strong> (older browsers, some in-app browsers) streams\nthe same scenes since 2.1, without post effects. Gaussian splats still\nneed WebGPU. <em>(Update, 4.0: the WebGL2 build now gets the studio\nlighting, shadows, bloom, optional ambient occlusion, reflection probes\nand real-time GI too.)</em></li><li><strong>Headsets.</strong> The WebXR mode is experimental and has not yet been\nverified on a physical headset.</li><li><strong>Materials.</strong> Vertex colours, texture transforms and the\n<code>KHR_materials_*</code> extensions (clearcoat, transmission, sheen and\nsimilar) are not rendered yet.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"where-to-read-more\">Where to read more<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#where-to-read-more\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/docs/changelog\" id=\"lnk-changelog-4\">changelog</a> — every change, newest first; updated\nwith each release.</li><li><a href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-3-million-triangle-b\">How Verse streams a 3-million-triangle building into your browser in seconds</a>\n— the idea behind all of this, explained with diagrams.</li><li>The <a href=\"/docs/getting-started\" id=\"lnk-getting-started-guide\">getting-started guide</a> — five minutes from a\nfile to a link.</li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#in-one-paragraph\" id=\"lnk-in-one-paragraph\">In one paragraph</a><a href=\"#what-you-can-do-now\" id=\"lnk-what-you-can-do-now\">What you can do now</a><a href=\"#what-changed-if-you-were-already-using-verse\" id=\"lnk-what-changed-if-you-were-already-using-v\">What changed if you were already using Verse</a><a href=\"#what-is-still-beta\" id=\"lnk-what-is-still-beta\">What is still beta</a><a href=\"#where-to-read-more\" id=\"lnk-where-to-read-more\">Where to read more</a></aside></section>"}